OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight cloud and rain will
OL,6,Fhave largely cleared by morning.
OL,7,FBright spells and the odd shower
OL,8,Fthrough the rest of the morning. Dry
OL,9,Fin the afternoon with increasing
OL,10,Fbright or sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,13,Fevening with increasing clear spells
OL,14,Fand light winds. Staying dry overnight
OL,15,Fand becoming quite chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
