OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,6,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as cloud
OL,7,Fgradually spills east through the
OL,8,Fafternoon ahead of rain spreading east
OL,9,Ffrom late afternoon. Gusty winds
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,13,Fand patchy rain clearing east on
OL,14,FFriday morning. Then bright spells and
OL,15,Fshowers and Friday and Saturday,
OL,16,Fbecoming quite frequent Friday night.
OL,17,FWindy as rain spreads east on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
